 "description": "Not a word list — a system. Close the gap between the words you recognise and the words you can actually use: how words stick, how to mine context, what roots buy you, why connotation and register decide which word fits, then the families themselves — verbs, adjectives, character, argument, change, confusables, idioms, borrowings and academic register. Ends with the discipline that keeps it honest: knowing when the plain word is the better one.",
